# ============================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT STEPS
# ============================================
# 1. Push your code to GitHub
# 2. Go to Vercel Dashboard (vercel.com)
# 3. Click "Add New Project"
# 4. Import your GitHub repository
# 5. Go to "Environment Variables" section
# 6. Add the 2 variables above:
#    - Variable name: VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#    - Value: https://wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls.supabase.co
#    - Environments: Production, Preview, Development
#    
#    - Variable name: VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#    - Value: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
#    - Environments: Production, Preview, Development
# 7. Click "Deploy"
# 8. Wait for deployment to complete
# 9. Visit your deployed site
# 10. Go to /supabase-test to verify everything works
# ============================================

# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: SUPABASE SETUP REQUIRED
# ============================================
# Before your app works, you MUST:
# 
# 1. Run Database Schema:
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/sql
#    - Click "New Query"
#    - Copy entire content from SUPABASE_DATABASE_SCHEMA.sql
#    - Paste and click "Run"
#
# 2. Create Storage Bucket:
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/storage/buckets
#    - Click "New bucket"
#    - Name: products
#    - Make it Public
#    - Click "Create"
#
# 3. Update Supabase Site URL:
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/auth/url-configuration
#    - Add your Vercel domain (e.g., your-app.vercel.app)
#    - Click "Save"
#
# 4. Enable Realtime:
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/database/replication
#    - Enable replication for: products, orders, transactions
#    - Click "Save"
# ============================================
